OL,3,GNEWSAFilm celebrates how salt made spa
OL,4,Atown 'wonky'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA film will celebrate and explore how a
OL,7,Fpopular condiment made a market town's
OL,8,Fhigh street "wonky".
OL,10,FDroitwich Spa became a hub for salt
OL,11,Fextraction during the Industrial
OL,12,FRevolution.
OL,14,FBut the effects of too much brine being
OL,15,Fpumped to the surface of the town
OL,16,Fcaused the ground to sink and buildings
OL,17,Fto lean - prompting the Wonky High
OL,18,FStreet nickname, Wychavon District
OL,19,FCouncil said.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
