OL,3,GNEWSAFilm celebrates how salt made spa
OL,4,Atown 'wonky'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe animation, part of a project
OL,7,Fstarted by Droitwich Spa Place Board,
OL,8,Fwill be shown at Tower Hill Brine Pump,
OL,9,Fwhich has been pumping brine since 1921
OL,10,Fand is the town's last working well.
